        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/04260b913f2d32fd77b82d26f69b4cab.avif?t=1787837022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras_big/04260b913f2d32fd77b82d26f69b4cab.webp?t=1787837022 width=1560 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Choice of Life franchise returns in a new game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gray concrete walls of the living cell, closing the hermetic door at the sound of a siren - all this is commonplace in Gigastructure. Everything here goes its way, until the block is isolated in search of a secret object...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/8f6f2255d5275c5ab713387d72742767.avif?t=1787837022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras_big/8f6f2255d5275c5ab713387d72742767.webp?t=1787837022 width=1560 height=329 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features of the new game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique setting, based on the universe of Gigastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cool 2D-illustrations, from the best artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-linear plot, where every choice can have unpredictable consequences</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/04260b913f2d32fd77b82d26f69b4cab.avif?t=1787837022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras_big/04260b913f2d32fd77b82d26f69b4cab.webp?t=1787837022 width=1560 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Choice of Life franchise returns in a new game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gray concrete walls of the living cell, closing the hermetic door at the sound of a siren - all this is commonplace in Gigastructure. Everything here goes its way, until the block is isolated in search of a secret object...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/8f6f2255d5275c5ab713387d72742767.avif?t=1787837022\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras_big/8f6f2255d5275c5ab713387d72742767.webp?t=1787837022 width=1560 height=329 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features of the new game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique setting, based on the universe of Gigastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cool 2D-illustrations, from the best artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-linear plot, where every choice can have unpredictable consequences</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "You're just a simple inhabitant of the endless Gigastructure. The best you'll get is seven shifts at a machine and a bowl of feed concentrate, and that for good service to the party.... Is that it? Or do you have a choice?",
        "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil",
